{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a91cc3ea120a66ce6e00fe6ca2236140fe8ac272085033e620ffc2bdfc8f262b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_b:2_4_013_01_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c9a1181eba7d80b6872e63766042ff908c747136e130cafce2489d2c6482f1d",
      "text": "……啊，监督！听我说啊。我的情境设定\n不是体育场的VIP包厢吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_b:2_4_013_01_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b085ba0eb9cc88b6c4072b552d457463a58f3ffc62243d653c579e88e5852541",
      "text": "我跟悠介说了之后，他羡慕得不行。\n说什么“我也想做——”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_b:2_4_013_01_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58eed655d1fb6098c6ce0023a4980f1deab61881127452c02e429ef5664b8a24",
      "text": "然后还跟我说要加油。既然被他加了油，\n就必须拿出好表现给悠介看看才行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_b:2_4_013_01_09_b:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba585c4cfea078beb4657e47ca68eeb52ec110bfc494efb2e92c097e6f29136a",
      "text": "带着享介先生的风格\n去加油吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_b:2_4_013_01_09_b:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4663e12a9e706222d2d6d4998cfb7ec905108e1d3b8208df800e991a174a98e6",
      "text": "照平时那样去发挥\n一定没问题的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_b:2_4_013_01_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a80aed92b36ff9cde8c39cfb205e3bc034b90c7f3727a488e9ccad72aeb96f0",
      "text": "嘿嘿，●●●●●●●●●●监督，\n谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_401_2_4_013_01_09_b:2_4_013_01_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02e8879682b3af614993e1855e186d0b059441ba290abc6bdb27688cac90c86e",
      "text": "会是怎样的圣诞约会呢，你就好好期待吧。\n回头见！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
